<title>MONACO: SOCCER-MONACO ADD SPEHAR AND KONJIC TO SQUAD.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MONACO ADD SPEHAR AND KONJIC TO SQUAD.</headline>
<dateline>MONACO 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>French champions Monaco have added Croatian striker Robert Spehar and Bosnian defender Muhamed Konjic to their squad following two disappointing results.</p>
<p>Monaco lost 1-0 to Bordeau and drew 2-2 at home to newly promoted Chateauroux and Konjic could make his debut when Monaco travel to Lyon on Saturday.</p>
<p>&quot;It was necessary to dynamise the squad,&quot; said coach Jean Tigana.</p>
</text>
